            0.081
          ],
          "content": "The Other Side of Zero"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.121,
            0.834,
            0.164
          ],
          "content": "From the picture, we see that we can remove five zero pairs, and we are then left with – 3. Therefore (+ 5) + (– 8) = – 3."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.19,
            0.146,
            0.212
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_15_image_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.191,
            0.302,
            0.212
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.223,
            0.555,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": "1. Complete the additions using tokens. a. (+ 6) + (+ 4) b. (– 3) + (– 2) c. (+ 5) + (– 7) d. (– 2) + (+ 6)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.291,
            0.835,
            0.355
          ],
          "content": "2. Cancel the zero pairs in the following two sets of tokens. On what floor is the lift attendant in each case? What is the corresponding addition statement in each case?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.368,
            0.173,
            0.384
          ],
          "content": "a."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.362,
            0.344,
            0.399
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_15_image_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.458,
            0.366,
            0.483,
            0.384
          ],
          "content": "b."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.496,
            0.363,
            0.828,
            0.401
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
