        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.474,
            0.464,
            0.496
          ],
          "content": "**Using tokens for subtraction**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.504,
            0.834,
            0.569
          ],
          "content": "We have seen how to perform addition of integers with positive tokens and negative tokens. We can also perform subtraction using tokens!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.584,
            0.395,
            0.626
          ],
          "content": "**Example:** Let us subtract: (+5) – (+4)."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.575,
            0.589,
            0.828,
            0.631
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.608,
                0.637,
                0.762,
                0.656
              ],
              "content": "(+ 5) – (+ 4) = + 1"
            }
          ],
          "image_source": "images/page_15_image_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.64,
            0.514,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": "This is easy to do. From 5 positives take away 4 positives to see the result."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.697,
            0.395,
            0.74
          ],
          "content": "**Example:** Let us subtract: (–7) – (–5)."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.525,
            0.7,
            0.828,
            0.736
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_15_image_19.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.754,
            0.5,
            0.774
          ],
          "content": "Is (– 7) – (– 5) the same as (– 7) + (+ 5)?"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.449,
            0.971,
            0.55,
            0.985
          ],
          "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.599,
            0.747,
            0.753,
            0.766
          ],
          "content": "(–7) – (–5) = –2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.795,
            0.49,
            0.838
          ],
          "content": "**Example:** Let us subtract: (+5)–(+6). Put down 5 positives."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.556,
